{"analytics_identifier": null, "base_path": "/insolvency-and-your-vat", "content_id": "9666a998-bded-4e58-876c-ce8f392fb68e", "description": "Insolvency and your VAT registration, de-registration, pre-insolvency VAT Returns and final VAT bill. ", "details": {"body": "<p>If you or your business becomes bankrupt or insolvent, your insolvency practitioner will usually cancel your <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> registration and organise payment of your <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr>.</p>\n\n<p>HM Revenue and Customs (<abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr>) will:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>work out your final <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> bill based on what you owe up to the day before insolvency</li>\n  <li>send you a paper version of the <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> Return</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>You cannot complete the <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> Return using your online <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> account.</p>\n\n<p>It must not be signed. Instead, you or the insolvency practitioner should write:</p>\n\n<div class=\"example\">\n  <p>\u2018Completed from the books and records of [name of the company/trader].\u2019</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"exceptions\">Exceptions</h2>\n\n<p>You\u2019re still responsible for your <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> if you:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>are declared bankrupt and continue to trade</li>\n  <li>set up a voluntary arrangement to pay off your debts (sometimes known as a \u2018trust deed\u2019 in Scotland)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If you set up a voluntary arrangement, <abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr> will send you 2 paper <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> Returns. These are for the following periods:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>your current <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> period up to the day before the arrangement</li>\n  <li>the date of the arrangement up to the end of your next <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> period</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>After this, you can continue to use your online <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> account to send your <abbr title=\"Value Added Tax\">VAT</abbr> Returns.</p>\n\n<div role=\"note\" aria-label=\"Warning\" class=\"application-notice help-notice\">\n<p>You must send any VAT Returns that were not done before you became insolvent to the <a href=\"/government/organisations/hm-revenue-customs/contact/vat-insolvency\">HMRC VAT Controller</a>. Your insolvency practitioner may do this for you.</p>\n</div>\n\n", "external_related_links": []}, "document_type": "answer", "first_published_at": "2012-09-13T13:35:30+01:00", "links": {"available_translations": [{"api_path": "/api/content/insolvency-and-your-vat", "api_url": "https://www.gov.uk/api/content/insolvency-and-your-vat", "base_path": "/insolvency-and-your-vat", "content_id": "9666a998-bded-4e58-876c-ce8f392fb68e", "document_type": "answer", "links": {}, "locale": "en", "public_updated_at": "2014-09-24T14:59:20Z", "schema_name": "answer", "title": "Insolvency and your VAT", "web_url": "https://www.gov.uk/insolvency-and-your-vat", "withdrawn": false}], "document_collections": [{"api_path": "/api/content/government/collections/vat-detailed-information", "api_url": "https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/collections/vat-detailed-information", "base_path": "/government/collections/vat-detailed-information", "content_id": "571aac49-e956-4f2d-9c01-44184522fb18", "document_type": "document_collection", "links": {"documents": [{"api_path": "/api/content/insolvency-and-your-vat", "api_url": "https://www.gov.uk/api/content/insolvency-and-your-vat", "base_path": "/insolvency-and-your-vat", "content_id": "9666a998-bded-4e58-876c-ce8f392fb68e", "document_type": "answer", "links": {}, "locale": "en", "public_updated_at": "2014-09-24T14:59:20Z", "schema_name": "answer", "title": "Insolvency and your VAT", "web_url": "https://www.gov.uk/insolvency-and-your-vat", "withdrawn": false}]}, "locale": "en", "public_upd